{
  "$comment": "Decoder test vectors. service: 16-bit BLE service UUID (hex) the payload was advertised under. payload: service data (hex). expect: null if it must not decode. weight_kg is compared with 0.01 tolerance. Every implementation (Python package, ESP32 firmware) must pass these.",
  "cases": [
